hilt/libfdt/ is a minimally modified version of upstream libfdt that is
distributed with the dtc project hosted at github.com/dgibson/dtc.git.

This version is taken from dtc.git commit 8f48565 ("Bump version to v1.8.1")
by copying all files from the libfdt/ directory.

The only modifications from the upstream source are the additions of this
file and changes to meson.build for cross compiling with picolibc.

Local libfdt changes should be kept to a minimum, and submitted upstream if
possible.
